        <dc:creator>@karpathy</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>This is the the quote I've been citing a lot recently.</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>kache (@yacineMTB)</b>
<p>
<p>you can outsource your thinking<br>
but you cannot outsource your understanding</p>

</p>
